    "PositionManager and GlpManager are direct contracts; the later GlpManager deployment sets the age. The 2024 Timelock swap (Vault.gov) is a new holder of an unchanged role with the same PositionManager handler grant, and later fee/weight changes only size the loss, so neither resets.",
